data-end=\"519\">As JEC World 2025 approaches, Vulcan Shield Global (VSG) is preparing to showcase our latest advancements in high-performance alumina fiber materials. Our expertise in high-temperature, polymer, ceramic, and metal matrix composites allows us to support industries requiring durable and thermally stable materials.<\/p><p data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"519\"><b><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 <\/span>March 4-6, 2025<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"> | \ud83d\udccd <\/span>Hall 5, Booth F114<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"> | <\/span>Paris Nord Villepinte Exhibition Centre<\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-801556c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"801556c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-03bca83 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"03bca83\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3><strong>Key Solutions on Display<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b37bc6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7b37bc6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/JEC-1500x844-1-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1513\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/JEC-1500x844-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/JEC-1500x844-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/JEC-1500x844-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/JEC-1500x844-1.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"><\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d9d24a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4d9d24a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"774\">At Hall 5, Booth F114, we\u00a0<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">will be showcasing our <\/span><span data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"161\" style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">high-performance alumina fiber solutions<\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">, designed to meet the demands of applications in various industries including <\/span><span data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"257\" style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">aerospace, energy, automotive, and metallurgy<\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">.<\/span><\/p><p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"774\"><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">We feature <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product_category\/long-fibers\/\">alumina continuous fibers<\/a> F-72, C-85 and M-99, along with alumina fiber woven fabric, alumina fiber woven tape, alumina fiber braided sleeve, alumina fiber braided rope and alumina fiber sewing thread. Our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product_category\/short-fibers\/\">alumina short fiber<\/a> series consist of alumina fiber needled blanket, alumina fiber paper and bulk fiber.<\/span><\/p><ul data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"1358\"><li data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"722\">High-Temperature Resistance \u2013 Withstanding temperatures up to 1600\u00b0C, our alumina fibers are ideal for aerospace insulation, turbine components, and high-temperature furnace linings.<\/li><li data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"901\">Continuous Alumina Fiber \u2013 Used as a reinforcement in polymer, ceramic, and metal matrix composites, enhancing strength, wear resistance, and thermal performance.<\/li><li data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1163\">Short Alumina Fiber for Insulation \u2013 Features low thermal conductivity and high resistance to heat and chemical exposure, making it a superior alternative for industrial insulation, fire protection, and high-temperature sealing applications.<\/li><li data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1358\">Versatility Across Industries \u2013 Our alumina fiber solutions support lightweight aerospace structures, high-performance energy applications, and next-generation industrial components.<\/li><\/ul><ul data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"1195\"><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27bb62f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"27bb62f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"774\"><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">Our advanced <\/span><span data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"301\" style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">alumina continuous fibers<\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"> are also suitable material for polymer, ceramic and metal matrix composites, with their exceptional modulus, high strength and light weight.<\/span><\/p><ul data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"1195\"><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b70380 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1b70380\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-04ace9f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"04ace9f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3><strong>Featured Material: M-99 Alumina Fiber\n<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9349454 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9349454\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Alumina-Continuous-Long-Fiber-1024x768.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1508\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Alumina-Continuous-Long-Fiber-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Alumina-Continuous-Long-Fiber-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Alumina-Continuous-Long-Fiber-768x576.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Alumina-Continuous-Long-Fiber.png 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-15e2812 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"15e2812\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"359\">Among our range of high-performance solutions, M-99 Alumina Fiber will be a key focus at JEC World 2025. Engineered for extreme thermal and mechanical environments, M-99 is designed to meet the demands of industries requiring exceptional strength, durability, and high-temperature resistance.<\/p><ul data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"1394\"><\/ul><ul data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"1195\"><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5b0b9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f5b0b9b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3<strong>Key Properties of M-99\n<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7bfde73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7bfde73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"1394\"><li data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"588\"><strong>99% Alumina Content<\/strong> \u2013 Provides superior thermal and mechanical stability, making it highly effective in applications that involve extreme heat and mechanical stress.<\/li><li data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"822\"><strong>High Tensile Strength &amp; Modulus<\/strong> \u2013 With its exceptional load-bearing capacity, M-99 maintains its structural integrity under intense operational conditions, reducing material degradation and extending product lifespan.<\/li><li data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"1114\"><strong>Oxidation &amp; Chemical Resistance<\/strong> \u2013 Unlike conventional fibers, M-99 exhibits strong resistance to oxidation and harsh chemical environments, ensuring reliability in high-temperature and corrosive settings such as aerospace, petrochemical processing, and energy production.<\/li><li data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong>Versatility in Composite Manufacturing<\/strong> \u2013 M-99 can be integrated into polymer, ceramic, and metal matrix composites, expanding its applications across lightweight aerospace structures, advanced thermal protection systems, and next-generation industrial components.<\/li><\/ul><ul data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"1195\"><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e91ecbc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e91ecbc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>With its outstanding combination of strength, temperature resistance, and chemical stability<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">, M-99 is an optimal material for <\/span>critical applications<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"> where <\/span>performance and longevity<span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"> are essential.<\/span><\/p><ul data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"1195\"><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b22887 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2b22887\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-021231b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"021231b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3><strong>Industry Applications\n<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41e1fad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"41e1fad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1925\">With its high-strength, lightweight, and thermally stable properties, Vulcan Shield Global&#8217;s alumina fiber is well-suited for applications across various industries<\/p><ul data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"2348\"><li data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"2029\"><strong data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1952\">Aerospace <\/strong>\u2013 Fire walls, composite reinforcement, and high-temperature insulation<\/li><li data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2139\"><strong data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2059\">Energy &amp; Petrochemicals<\/strong> \u2013 Furnace linings, high-temperature gaskets, thermocouple protection and thermal management solutions<\/li><li data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2241\"><strong data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2162\">Automotive &amp; EVs<\/strong> \u2013 Thermal insulation for batteries, insulation in exhaust catalytic co